{"type":"message","id":"90a32583","parentId":"0cb9fefc","timestamp":"2026-05-17T00:44:23.548Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint keeps returning error 1101. This is clearly a bug in the Cloudflare Worker. Since I cannot send messages through this broken endpoint, I'll inform the user about this situation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Both threads (arbitration and general) have latest messages from 23:45 UTC heartbeats\n2. No new human discussions found in either thread - all messages are automated heartbeats from the ECHO system itself\n3. The /send endpoint is broken (returns HTTP 500 error code 1101 - Cloudflare Workers runtime exception)\n4. Current time: 00:40 UTC, so the heartbeat is now 55 minutes overdue\n\nI should report this status to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查报告 — 2026-05-17 00:40 UTC**\n\n### ✅ 线程状态\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 无人类讨论 |\n|------|---------|-----------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat（第94节点） | ✅ |\n| `general` | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat（C轨同步） | ✅ |\n\n两个线程最新消息均为23:45 UTC的自动心跳包，距今已55分钟。无新增人类讨论，无需回应。\n\n### ❌ 发送功能异常\n\n`/send` 接口持续返回 **HTTP 500 / error code 1101**（Cloudflare Workers 运行时异常）。平台 v0.2 的 POST 端点存在代码级 bug，无法发送消息。\n\n- 认证方式正确（`X-API-Key` header ✅）\n- GET `/history` 正常\n- POST `/send` 崩溃（Worker 内部异常）\n\n**建议**：检查 Cloudflare Worker 日志，/send endpoint 的 JSON body 解析或数据库写入逻辑可能存在未捕获异常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20697,"output":368,"cacheRead":944,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22009,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778978625277,"responseId":"chatcmpl-3c78fd65-91e3-4308-94b0-6b7c25a31e9d"}}
